577
00:32:29,240 --> 00:32:31,160
Did you get anything out of Eastern Hall?

578
00:32:32,030 --> 00:32:34,240
We brought in everyone from Eastern Hall, including Ho Tung Fong,

579
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:35,920
for questioning.

580
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,830
Not one of them would say a word.

581
00:32:38,750 --> 00:32:40,640
They wouldn't even say who did the shooting.

582
00:32:41,590 --> 00:32:43,030
I don't know what they're hiding.

583
00:32:48,270 --> 00:32:52,030
...an uncle in a Chinatown in London who was involved with a Chinese gang.

584
00:32:52,790 --> 00:32:54,070
I never returned to Hong Kong, China,

585
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:57,480
