586
00:32:58,000 --> 00:33:00,200
I'll come back to Hong Kong, China to find you.

587
00:33:03,590 --> 00:33:05,400
As soon as I came back, I looked everywhere for you.

588
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:07,590
I'll come back to Hong Kong, China to find you.

589
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:15,110
I'll come back to Hong Kong, China to find you.

590
00:33:15,110 --> 00:33:15,720
