591
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:16,880
Wait.

592
00:33:18,070 --> 00:33:19,200
My family was too poor back then.

593
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:20,750
I could never eat the food I craved.

594
00:33:29,030 --> 00:33:29,920
Listen to this.

595
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:31,830
I went to study in London.

596
00:33:32,400 --> 00:33:33,830
I'll come back to Hong Kong, China to find you.

597
00:33:35,070 --> 00:33:36,480
Back to Hong Kong, China?

598
00:33:37,270 --> 00:33:39,030
"I'll come back to Hong Kong, China to find you."

599
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:43,590
That's Siu Yan's voice.

600
00:33:46,590 --> 00:33:47,640
Siu Yan? Which Siu Yan?

601
00:33:48,270 --> 00:33:49,400
The chairman of Feros.

602
00:33:50,480 --> 00:33:52,200
Fei Foon told me before

603
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:54,440
