642
00:35:33,070 --> 00:35:34,230
Did you find anything?

643
00:35:36,630 --> 00:35:38,280
It all makes sense now.

644
00:35:39,070 --> 00:35:43,510
Feros, Siu Yan, Dreamweaver, and Pedro...

645
00:35:44,030 --> 00:35:45,510
They're all connected.

646
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:49,630
At first, I thought Sheng Tung had simply attracted trouble

647
00:35:49,630 --> 00:35:50,440
